ed fixes, it can be. The recommendations should address each finding.\n\nThe Plain-Language Summary for the transit board should be simple, highlighting the main issues and the need for fixes. It should mention the critical issue and others, and that with changes, the site can be accessible.\n\nI need to make sure all the sections are in the right order and follow the contract. Also, check that all findings are included and properly categorized. Avoid any markdown in the thinking process, but the final answer should be in Markdown. Let me verify each section against the provided data to ensure nothing is missed.\n",
